# Punch indentation, quarter model: the quarter x >= 0, y >= 0 of a circular
# cylinder of radius R = 4a and height H = 4a, a = 1 mm, axis along z, base
# at z = 0, top face at z = H, indented by a rigid flat punch of radius a
# centered on the axis.  Units: mm.  Four-node tetrahedra; convert.jl adds
# the edge and face nodes.
# The quarter is the only volume meshed: the cylinder is cut by the planes
# x = 0 and y = 0 before meshing and the three other quarters are deleted, so
# that the symmetry planes, the base, the lateral surface, the footprint and
# the rest of the top face are separate surfaces.  The footprint (r <= a on
# the top face) is a separate surface, imprinted with a quarter circle on the
# top face only.  The region r <= 2a, z >= H - 2a is cut out and meshed at
# size h; the rest at size 4h.
# Parameters (aprepro): h = element size near the punch, out = output file.
#   cubit -batch -nographics -nojournal -noecho -information off \
#     "h=0.25" "out='meshes/punch-h4-tet4.g'" punch.jou
reset
create cylinder height 4 radius 4
move volume 1 z 2 include_merged
webcut volume all with plane xplane offset 0
webcut volume all with plane yplane offset 0
delete volume with x_coord < 0
delete volume with y_coord < 0
webcut volume all with cylinder radius 2 axis z
webcut volume all with plane zplane offset 2
create curve arc radius 1 center location 0 0 4 normal 0 0 1 start angle 0 stop angle 90
imprint volume all with curve all with z_coord > 3.999 and z_coord < 4.001 and is_free
delete curve all with is_free
imprint volume all
merge volume all
# Refined region: the volume r <= 2, z >= 2.
volume with z_coord > 2 and x_coord < 1.5 and y_coord < 1.5 size {h}
volume with z_coord > 2 and x_coord < 1.5 and y_coord < 1.5 scheme tetmesh
mesh volume with z_coord > 2 and x_coord < 1.5 and y_coord < 1.5
volume all size {4*h}
volume all scheme tetmesh
mesh volume all
volume all smooth scheme condition number beta 2.0 cpu 10
smooth volume all
block 1 volume all
block 1 name "cylinder"
block 1 element type TETRA4
nodeset 1 surface with z_coord < 1.0e-6
nodeset 1 name "base"
nodeset 2 surface with z_coord > 3.999999 and x_coord < 0.7 and y_coord < 0.7
nodeset 2 name "punch"
nodeset 3 surface with x_coord < 1.0e-6
nodeset 3 name "symm-x"
nodeset 4 surface with y_coord < 1.0e-6
nodeset 4 name "symm-y"
nodeset 5 curve with x_coord < 1.0e-6 and y_coord < 1.0e-6
nodeset 5 name "axis"
sideset 1 surface with z_coord > 3.999999 and x_coord < 0.7 and y_coord < 0.7
sideset 1 name "punch"
sideset 2 surface with z_coord > 3.999999 and (x_coord > 0.7 or y_coord > 0.7)
sideset 2 name "top"
sideset 3 surface with z_coord > 1.0e-6 and z_coord < 3.999999 and x_coord > 2.3 and y_coord > 2.3
sideset 3 name "lateral"
sideset 4 surface with x_coord < 1.0e-6
sideset 4 name "symm-x"
sideset 5 surface with y_coord < 1.0e-6
sideset 5 name "symm-y"
sideset 6 surface with z_coord < 1.0e-6
sideset 6 name "base"
list surface all
list nodeset all
list sideset all
quality volume all shape global
set large exodus file on
export mesh "{out}" overwrite
